    "body": "One more I noticed I can also split out into a different issue, but putting it down here for reference.\r\n\r\nParse a pattern string (https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-a-pattern-string), step 3.9.1 does:\r\n\r\n> 1. Set prefix be the result of running [consume text](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#consume-text) given parser.\r\n\r\nBut not prefix is in scope, so I believe should be 'let'. Similar story for modifier token on step 3.9.6",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
